# Cloudflare Pages redirects. The build copies this file to dist/_redirects;
# tests/deploy.test.mjs serves dist/ through `wrangler pages dev` and checks every
# rule, and that no rule's source is also a built file (a rule would hide the page).
# /examples/index.html needs no rule: Pages already answers it with a redirect to /examples/.
# The Ladle host (tryopendata.github.io/openchart) cannot be redirected from here;
# it is a separate GitHub Pages site.

/rss.xml /blog/rss.xml 301
/feed.xml /blog/rss.xml 301
/gallery /examples/ 301
/gallery/* /examples/:splat 301
